OL,3,GNEWSA'We thought we were going to die
OL,4,Ain rhino attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FZoe Farmer said she felt helpless in
OL,7,Fthe safari park: "You could see it
OL,8,Fcharging towards us with that huge horn
OL,9,Fon its head and I thought we were all
OL,10,Fgoing to die, I really did."
OL,12,FShe was with her husband and grandson
OL,13,Fwhile on a visit to West Midlands
OL,14,FSafari Park on 9 August.
OL,16,FThe 53-year-old NHS worker said the
OL,17,Fpark's wardens were "nowhere to be
OL,18,Fseen" during the attack and added she
OL,19,Ffelt the attraction had "washed their
OL,20,Fhands" with the incident, only offering
OL,21,Fa refund and another free visit.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
