OL,3,GNEWSA'We thought we were going to die
OL,4,Ain rhino attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a spokesperson for the park told
OL,7,Fthe BBC: "Our keepers responded
OL,8,Fimmediately to the altercation, checked
OL,9,Fall guests, and offered assistance to
OL,10,Fthose involved throughout the morning."
